  "invariants": [
    "A valid packet proves only that evidence is well formed and hash-bound.",
    "Template packets and captures are never evidence.",
    "A failed or ambiguous observation remains valid evidence but does not close a gate.",
    "Identity photos cannot resolve UART pins.",
    "Continuity evidence cannot auto-resolve a pin map without independent review.",
    "A passive capture contains no TX records and is compared byte-for-byte by concatenated source digest.",
    "Raw photos, captures, identifiers, and field payloads remain under the ignored private root.",
    "Only C008/T002 declarations under TARGET-T002-20260907 are current; A131 packets are historical, not current gate evidence."
  ],
